          "blocks": {
            "1756087446472b63d6ce": {
              "type": "$collapsible-group",
              "settings": {},
              "blocks": {
                "1756087446472110b1cd": {
                  "type": "$collapsible-panel",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "\u003cp\u003eCurrently, we have a limited number of \u003ca id=\"17574943265491\" href=\"/pages/payment-method\" target=\"_self\" data-link=\"{\u0026quot;pageType\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;value\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;payment-method\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;linkType\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;select\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;label\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;Payment Method\u0026quot;}\"\u003epayment methods\u003c/a\u003e available. However, we \u003cstrong\u003eplan\u003c/strong\u003e to add more payment options in the future.\u003c/p\u003e",
                    "icon": "chat_bubble",
                    "title": "What payment methods do you accept?"
                  },
                  "blocks": {},
                  "block_order": []
                },
                "1756087446472511209d": {
                  "type": "$collapsible-panel",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "Our customer service team is available \u003cstrong\u003eMonday to Friday, 8:30 am to 5:30 pm (GMT+8 time zone)\u003c/strong\u003e. If you have any questions during the shopping process, you can \u003ca id=\"17574940694041\" href=\"/pages/contact\" target=\"_self\" data-link=\"{\u0026quot;pageType\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;value\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;contact\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;linkType\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;select\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;label\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;Contact\u0026quot;}\"\u003ecommunicate with us online\u003c/a\u003e during these working hours.",
                    "icon": "chat_bubble",
                    "title": "How can I communicate with customer service online?"
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                },
                "17560874464728e5648f": {
                  "type": "$collapsible-panel",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "After a successful payment, you will receive an email with your order information. If you provided an email address during the payment process, you will be automatically registered as a user. You can \u003ca id=\"17574957179284\" href=\"/user/center\" target=\"_self\" data-link=\"{\u0026quot;pageType\u0026quot;:13,\u0026quot;value\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;user/center\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;linkType\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;select\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;label\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;个人中心页\u0026quot;}\"\u003elog in to our website\u003c/a\u003e using your email address to view your order. Alternatively, you can also register for a new account before making a payment.",
                    "icon": "chat_bubble",
                    "title": "How can I view my order?"
                  },
                  "blocks": {},
                  "block_order": []
                },
                "1756087446472b6bbf6c": {
                  "type": "$collapsible-panel",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "\u003cp\u003eWe will send an email with the tracking number to the email address you provided after \u003cstrong\u003eyour order has shipped\u003c/strong\u003e. You can use this number to track the shipment on the shipping company's website.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYou can also\u003c/strong\u003e log in to our website to view the tracking number for your shipment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo track your shipment, please visit the following webpage: \u003ca class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://track.4px.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003ehttps://track.4px.com/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
                    "icon": "chat_bubble",
                    "title": "How can I track the shipment?"
                  },
                  "blocks": {},
                  "block_order": []
                },
                "1757494736658f8363bd": {
                  "type": "$collapsible-panel",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "We ship all orders directly from our facility in China to the U.S. via our trusted partner, 4PX. You can typically expect your order to arrive within 10 days. All applicable taxes and shipping costs will be calculated and added at checkout for a seamless delivery experience. \u003ca id=\"17574951291372\" href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\" target=\"_self\" data-link=\"{\u0026quot;pageType\u0026quot;:5,\u0026quot;value\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;/policies/shipping-policy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;linkType\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;select\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;label\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;发货政策\u0026quot;}\"\u003eSee our Shipping Policy for all shipping details.\u003c/a\u003e",
                    "icon": "chat_bubble",
                    "title": "What are your shipping options, times, and costs?"
                  },
                  "blocks": {},
                  "block_order": []
                },
                "17574952383249c85baa": {
                  "type": "$collapsible-panel",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "Yes, you can. If your order has not yet been shipped, you can cancel it for a full refund or request a size/style change by contacting us via the contact form. Once an order has shipped, it cannot be modified or canceled. In that case, please see our \u003ca id=\"17574955990303\" href=\"/policies/refund-policy\" target=\"_self\" data-link=\"{\u0026quot;pageType\u0026quot;:5,\u0026quot;value\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;/policies/refund-policy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;linkType\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;select\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;label\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;退款政策\u0026quot;}\"\u003eRefund Policy\u003c/a\u003e for further instructions.",
                    "icon": "chat_bubble",
                    "title": "Can I change or cancel my order after I've placed it?"
                  },
                  "blocks": {},
                  "block_order": []
                }
              },
